{"title": "Culling Strikes", "pageid": 32758, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Culling_Strikes", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/300px-Generic_Psychic.webp, /w/images/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/300px-Generic_Psychic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Culling Strikes</b> is a passive feature unique to <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\">Ptaris' Mental Image</a> that allows it to create new mental images.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The Mental Image creates a new Mental Image each time it hits a character with an attack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\">Ptaris' Mental Image</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715092009\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 451/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1502/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 920/419430